        "TileImage": "$($repository ee9496db-8562-4737-80c1-9dc4fb4d5183).Image",
        "Description": "In the final dream level, Portman is attempting to escape Providence and the media, and plans to make a new life for himself and reconnect an old relationship . In order for our plan to work, however, you must eliminate him in an unceremonious and unsavory way to make him believe his facial reconstruction was pointless and brought more harm then good. This dream level is incredibly unstable, so you must be careful not to damage his mind or leave any evidence of your tampering. Good luck.",
